{"candidateAnswer":"Get a fluffy couch, weighted blanket, dimmable lights","evidence":"[D23:26 | 10:58 am on 9 October, 2022] Joanna: Sure! For one, you should get a couch that can sit multiple people so that you can lay down if you want, and make sure its really fluffy! Also invest in a blanket that has a little bit of weight to it, and some lights that can be dimmed.","itemId":"urn:uuid:573dec67-c7f2-5c7c-a412-46333fd89fe5","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:76003f0320df4c912fe8719dd9c6f9573a177ec403005281a90dfd38964eb657","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does Joanna recommend to make a living room comfy like hers?","referenceAnswer":"couch for multiple people, fluffy blanket, lights that can be dimmed","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"76003f0320df4c912fe8719dd9c6f9573a177ec403005281a90dfd38964eb657"}}]}